@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam roundCorner 10

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor<<Frontend>> #EAF3FF
    BorderColor<<Frontend>> #7A9EC2
    BackgroundColor<<Backend>> #EBF7EE
    BorderColor<<Backend>> #76A880
    BackgroundColor<<Data>> #FBEBF3
    BorderColor<<Data>> #B5849E
}

package "UniSpace" {

    package "Frontend (Client)" <<Frontend>> {
        [Client Application\n(Django UI / Templates)] as Client
        note right of Client
            Handles user interactions:
            - Schedule view
            - Room filtering & selection
            - Re-booking & cancellation
            - Conflict resolution dashboard
            - In-app notification center
        end note
    }

    () "REST API / Internal HTTP" as REST_API

    package "Backend (Business Logic)" <<Backend>> {
        [API Gateway & Router] as Gateway

        [Auth & User Service\n(RBAC & SSO Handler)] as AuthService
        note right of AuthService
            FR-001 - FR-003, SEC-002:
            Handles Microsoft SSO tokens,
            user sessions, and role checks.
        end note

        [CA3 Parser Service\n(Schedule Importer)] as SyncService
        note right of SyncService
            FR-004, FR-005, A-001:
            HTML parser reading
            schedule data from CA3.
        end note

        [Classroom Directory Service\n(Auditorium Registry)] as RoomService
        note right of RoomService
            FR-008, FR-009, FR-018:
            Manages rooms, capacity,
            and equipment.
        end note

        [Booking & Conflict Service\n(Core Engine)] as BookingService
        note bottom of BookingService
            FR-010 - FR-014, FR-020, REL-001:
            Handles re-booking, slot overlap validation,
            alternative room matching, and conflicts.
        end note

        [Notification Service\n(Email & In-App)] as NotificationService
        note right of NotificationService
            FR-015, FR-016:
            Dispatches change alerts to students
            and conflict warnings to teachers.
        end note

        [Audit Service\n(Immutable Audit Trail)] as AuditService
        note right of AuditService
            FR-017, SEC-003:
            Append-only change log:
            who, when, target room, and reason.
        end note

        [Data Access Layer\n(Django ORM)] as DAL
    }

    () "SQL / ORM" as SQL_Interface

    package "Data Layer" <<Data>> {
        database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Data Storage)" as DB
        note right of DB
            Stores:
            - Users & roles
            - Imported CA3 schedules
            - Classrooms & equipment
            - Active bookings & cancellations
            - Append-only audit logs
        end note
    }
}

cloud "External Systems" {
    [CA3 System (САЗ)\n(HTML Schedule Source)] as CA3
    [Microsoft Identity Platform\n(MS SSO)] as MSSO
    [SMTP Server\n(Corporate / Test Mail)] as SMTP
}

Client --> REST_API
REST_API --> Gateway

Gateway ..> AuthService : Auth / RBAC
Gateway ..> RoomService : Room directory queries
Gateway ..> BookingService : Booking & cancellation requests
Gateway ..> SyncService : Sync triggers (Dispatcher)
Gateway ..> AuditService : Audit log requests
Gateway ..> NotificationService : In-app notifications

BookingService ..> RoomService : Check capacity & equipment
BookingService ..> NotificationService : Trigger alerts on change
BookingService ..> AuditService : Record booking actions
SyncService ..> BookingService : Register default bookings & conflicts
SyncService ..> NotificationService : Notify on collisions

AuthService ..> DAL
SyncService ..> DAL
RoomService ..> DAL
BookingService ..> DAL
AuditService ..> DAL
NotificationService ..> DAL

DAL --> SQL_Interface
SQL_Interface --> DB

AuthService ..> MSSO : Validate tokens
SyncService ..> CA3 : HTTP GET / HTML Parsing (Read-Only)
NotificationService ..> SMTP : Dispatch emails (SMTP)
@enduml
